The data are read from Isypower Cloud (application.izypowercloud.fr), the cloud
of the Isypower range of Materfrance, with the account of the user. Its API has
no public documentation: the endpoints, headers and payloads come from the Home
Assistant integration izypower_cloud by Stefan Plizga
(https://github.com/StefanPlizga/izypower_cloud), released under the MIT
License. No code of that project is included; this integration is a new
implementation in JavaScript.

This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
Materfrance or Isypower.
